      "value": "Simulacrum"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "A dark and haunting spell that allows the caster to summon eerie doppelgangers of themselves, each a grotesque mirror reflecting their every move. \n\nThe power of these macabre replicas is directly tied to the vitality the caster willingly sacrifices, as "
        },
        {
          "text": "every drop of blood and health lost endows the clones with greater reserves of arcane strength.",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " \n\nAs they move in lockstep with the caster, these spectral entities "
        },
        {
          "text": "echo their every incantation",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ", unleashing a torrent of spells with relentless ferocity.  They are capable of summoning magics, though their ability is limited.  Drawing on their dark power, they are even able to eschew reagent requirements, provided the original spell they are mimicking has already consumed its own.\n\nHowever, their fiendish existence is not without a grim price: "
        },
        {
          "text": "once their magical reserves are expended, the clones dissolve",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " into a chilling pool of blood, leaving a grim reminder of the dark bargain struck in the pursuit of power.\n\nSuch bargains can only be struck by those aligned with the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Fey",
          "color": "dark_green"
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
